@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Health Check Probe
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Get All Classes
GET {{baseUrl}}/classes
Accept: application/json

###

### Create Class (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/classes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Class 10 - Science",
  "totalSeats": 30
}

###

### Create Seat Hold (Student)
POST {{baseUrl}}/classes/c_11f483a4/holds
Content-Type: application/json
X-Student-Id: 20081234567890123

###

### Get Student Application History
GET {{baseUrl}}/me/holds
Accept: application/json
X-Student-Id: 20081234567890123
